The r_24 is mapped north of r_88.
Understand "serious cubicle 12" as r_90.
The internal name of r_90 is "serious cubicle 12".
The printed name of r_90 is "-= Serious Cubicle 12 =-".
The serious cubicle 12 part 0 is some text that varies. The serious cubicle 12 part 0 is "Well, here we are in a serious cubicle 12.



You don't like doors? Why not try going south, that entranceway is unguarded.".
The description of r_90 is "[serious cubicle 12 part 0]".

The r_26 is mapped south of r_90.
Understand "pleasant chamber" as r_91.
The internal name of r_91 is "pleasant chamber".
The printed name of r_91 is "-= Pleasant Chamber =-".
The pleasant chamber part 0 is some text that varies. The pleasant chamber part 0 is "Ah, the chamber. This is some kind of chamber, really great pleasant vibes in this place, a wonderful pleasant atmosphere. And now, well, you're in it. You start to take note of what's in the room.



You need an unblocked exit? You should try going north.".
The description of r_91 is "[pleasant chamber part 0]".

The r_27 is mapped north of r_91.
Understand "gloomy vault" as r_94.
The internal name of r_94 is "gloomy vault".
The printed name of r_94 is "-= Gloomy Vault =-".
The gloomy vault part 0 is some text that varies. The gloomy vault part 0 is "You arrive in a vault. A gloomy kind of place.



There is an unguarded exit to the north.".
The description of r_94 is "[gloomy vault part 0]".

The r_30 is mapped north of r_94.
Understand "spacious closet" as r_95.
The internal name of r_95 is "spacious closet".
The printed name of r_95 is "-= Spacious Closet =-".
The spacious closet part 0 is some text that varies. The spacious closet part 0 is "You are in a closet. A spacious kind of place.



You need an unblocked exit? You should try going south.".
The description of r_95 is "[spacious closet part 0]".

The r_31 is mapped south of r_95.
Understand "clean restroom" as r_96.
The internal name of r_96 is "clean restroom".
The printed name of r_96 is "-= Clean Restroom =-".
The clean restroom part 0 is some text that varies. The clean restroom part 0 is "You arrive in a restroom. A clean kind of place. The room seems oddly familiar, as though it were only superficially different from the other rooms in the building.



There is an unguarded exit to the north.".
The description of r_96 is "[clean restroom part 0]".

The r_32 is mapped north of r_96.
Understand "spotless launderette" as r_99.
The internal name of r_99 is "spotless launderette".
The printed name of r_99 is "-= Spotless Launderette =-".
The spotless launderette part 0 is some text that varies. The spotless launderette part 0 is "You find yourself in a launderette. A spotless one.



There is an exit to the north. Don't worry, it is unguarded.".
The description of r_99 is "[spotless launderette part 0]".

The r_35 is mapped north of r_99.

